# /etc/dendrite/dendrite-ui.env
#
# Deployment-specific overrides for dendrite-ui.service, loaded via
# EnvironmentFile. See docs/CONFIGURATION.md for the full variable
# reference. This file is installed as-is by the .deb package
# (packaging/dendrite-ui.env.example is its single source of truth) and is a
# conffile: your edits survive package upgrades.

# Where dendrited's HTTP/WebSocket API lives, from the browser's point of
# view. Left unset (the default), the UI assumes dendrited is reachable at
# the same origin the UI itself was loaded from — true for the common case
# of a reverse proxy in front of both. Set this when dendrited is on a
# different host or port than the UI (e.g. a future "herd" multi-host
# deployment, or simply dendrited's default 127.0.0.1:8766 reached through
# a different public hostname):
#DENDRITE_UI_API_ORIGIN=http://localhost:8766
